## Third-party content

The member briefs under `teams/*/members/` for `trading-team`,
`stock-partner-team` and `gpt-researcher-team` are ported from WorkBuddy expert
packages (Tencent). Their roster structure, phase design and specialist
instructions originate from those packages; the data-acquisition sections were
rewritten for DeepSeek Harness. See each team's `team.json` `source` field for
the exact upstream package and version.

`teams/product-strategy-team/` is **not** ported — its briefs were written for
this plugin from a WorkBuddy catalog entry, and its `team.json` records
`source.kind: "authored"`.

Review the upstream terms before redistributing this plugin publicly.
